      "description": "The battle at the Darkspear Islands be locked in a stalemate, {class}. Show those Alliance fools who the superior force is. \r\n\r\nCarry your head high in service of the Darkspear and claim victory in battle. The Loa will surely be givin' you their blessing, {class}!",
